10 REM Essai des couleurs sur la cartouche GX4000 (D186)
20 MODE 0:BORDER 0:INK 0,0
30 FOR I=1 TO 15:INK I,I+10:NEXT
40 FOR I=1 TO 15
50 LOCATE 3,I+3:PEN I:PRINT "STYLO";I
60 NEXT
70 PEN 1:LOCATE 1,22:PRINT "TIR 1 : SUITE"
80 WHILE INKEY(47):WEND:WHILE INKEY(47)=0:WEND
